Cc: Leonid Maksymchuk <leonmaxx@gmail.com>, Andy Shevchenko <andriy.shevchenko@linux.intel.com>, Sasha Levin <sashal@kernel.org>, acpi4asus-user@lists.sourceforge.net, platform-driver-x86@vger.kernel.org
